Implement a Notification Service for a microservice architecture system called SkillSnap.

This service must:

Consume events from RabbitMQ

Convert events into notifications

Store notifications in SQL Server

Provide REST APIs for frontend

Provide realtime notifications using SignalR

Maintain its own SignalR Hub (do NOT reuse Chat Service)

The service must be independent from Chat Service.

System Architecture Context

The system uses event-driven microservices.

Services communicate via RabbitMQ event bus.

Example services:

Community Service

Portfolio Service

Connection Service

Company Service

Chat Service

Notification Service

Notification Service listens to events and generates notifications.

Architecture flow:

Service → RabbitMQ → Notification Service → Database
                                 │
                                 ▼
                           SignalR Hub
                                 │
                                 ▼
                              Frontend
